### 1. Get Total Doctors
GET http://localhost:4004/api/analytics/doctors/count
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 2. Get Doctors By Department
GET http://localhost:4004/api/analytics/doctors/department/Cardiology
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 3. Get Doctors By City
GET http://localhost:4004/api/analytics/doctors/city/Delhi
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 4. Get All Doctors
GET http://localhost:4004/api/analytics/doctors
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}